{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52077","headline":"宗庙九德之歌辞 · 褚亮","name":"宗庙九德之歌辞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"皇祖诞庆，於昭於天。\n积德斯远，茂绪攸（一作「攸绪」）先。\n继天应历（一作「维文应历」），神武弘宣。\n肇迹嬀水，成功版（一作「坂」）泉。\n道光覆载，声穆乾元（一作「吉先」），式备牺象，用洁牲牷。\n礼终九献，乐展四悬。\n神贶景福，遐哉永年。\n（见中华书局排印本《初学记》卷十三）（按：《全唐诗》卷八八二《补遗》已收此诗，有缺文，故重录出。\n注「一作」者，爲《全唐诗》所收本异文。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"褚亮","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52077.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52077","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}